damaged_code:
```rust
struct Line {
    start: Point,
    end: Point,
    length: f64,
}

impl Line {
    fn set_start(&mut self, new_start: Point) {
        self.start = new_start;
        // If developer forgets to recalculate self.length here, an invariant breaks.
    }
}
```

fix:
Expose the derived value through an on-demand calculation method rather than a data field.
```rust
struct Line {
    start: Point,
    end: Point,
}

impl Line {
    fn length(&self) -> f64 {
        self.start.distance_to(&self.end)
    }
}
```
